    - Term: Leaderboard_RankingDes1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - With a little more effort,rewards are yours!
      - "\xA1Con un poco m\xE1s de esfuerzo, las recompensas ser\xE1n tuyas!"
      - "Com um pouco mais de esfor\xE7o, as recompensas ser\xE3o suas!"
      - "\u0415\u0449\u0435 \u043D\u0435\u043C\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E \u0443\u0441\u0438\u043B\u0438\u0439
