    - Term: RankResultDes4_2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - So close, you're just one step away from the reward!
      - "\xA1Tan cerca, est\xE1s a solo un paso de la recompensa!"
      - "T\xE3o perto, voc\xEA est\xE1 a apenas um passo da recompensa!"
      - "\u0422\u0430\u043A \u0431\u043B\u0438\u0437\u043A\u043E, \u0442\u044B \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0433\u043E
