    - Term: JungleQuest_MatchingDes
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Finding players on your level.
      - Buscando jugadores de tu nivel.
      - "Procurando jogadores do seu n\xEDvel."
      - "\u0418\u0449\u0435\u043C \u0438\u0433\u0440\u043E\u043A\u043E\u0432 \u0442\u0432\u043E\u0435\u0433\u043E
