      Description: "\u8BF4\u660E\u9875/\u9996\u6B21\u5F15\u5BFC"
      Languages:
      - The grand prize will be shared equally between winners!
      - "\xA1El gran premio se dividir\xE1 equitativamente entre los ganadores!"
      - "O grande pr\xEAmio ser\xE1 dividido igualmente entre os vencedores!"
      - "\u0413\u043B\u0430\u0432\u043D\u044B\u0439 \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0437 \u0434\u0435\u043B\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044F
