      - <color=#F74539>{0}</color> ve <color=#F74539>{1}</color> ilerlemeni kaybedeceksin!
      - "\u4F60\u5C06\u4F1A\u5931\u53BB\u4F60\u7684<color=#F74539>{0}</color>\u548C<color=#F74539>{1}</color>\u8FDB\u5EA6\uFF01"
